      "start_seconds": 1.19,
      "end_seconds": 5.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "Hi is it okay to come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.12,
      "end_seconds": 9.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "no problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.6,
      "end_seconds": 21.91,
      "duration_seconds": 10.31,
      "text": "It's blood in the urine. I thought I'd wait but it hasn't gone. I've been reading about it online and it worried me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.67,
      "end_seconds": 24.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.29,
      "end_seconds": 29.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "It's been going on for about a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.28,
      "end_seconds": 34.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.83,
      "end_seconds": 50.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.27,
      "end_seconds": 83.19,
      "duration_seconds": 11.92,
      "text": "okay: height 154 centimetres temp 36.6 degrees weight 63 kilos and oxygen saturation is 97 percent heart rate 66 pressure 109 over 81 BMI works out to 26.6."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.49,
      "end_seconds": 87.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Shall I start the the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.95,
      "end_seconds": 91.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Hold that for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.55,
      "end_seconds": 110.13,
      "duration_seconds": 6.58,
      "text": "you are writhing in pain with tenderness in the left loin but your tummy is soft"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.84,
      "end_seconds": 118.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "okay, that's enough for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.67,
      "end_seconds": 136.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Have you noticed fever or vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.91,
      "end_seconds": 140.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "No fever or vomiting none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.8,
      "end_seconds": 149.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "have you had any passing no urine or burning when passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.85,
      "end_seconds": 156.38,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "No passing no urine or burning when passing urine none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.92,
      "end_seconds": 161.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "what about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.19,
      "end_seconds": 166.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "bowels are regular, nothing odd"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.62,
      "end_seconds": 170.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.62,
      "end_seconds": 185.87,
      "duration_seconds": 14.25,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.33,
      "end_seconds": 191.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "are you taking anything regularly including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.39,
      "end_seconds": 208.02,
      "duration_seconds": 15.63,
      "text": "Glibenclamide 5 milligrams before breakfast for my sugar. My neighbour said I should get it looked at. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.56,
      "end_seconds": 223.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.59,
      "end_seconds": 226.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "no, not at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.18,
      "end_seconds": 243.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.07,
      "end_seconds": 248.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "no, um, I'm not allergic to anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.89,
      "end_seconds": 253.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.98,
      "end_seconds": 261.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "I have diabetes, for nearly five years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.09,
      "end_seconds": 270.11,
      "duration_seconds": 7.02,
      "text": "putting it all together, I think we're dealing with kidney stone colic at this stage"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.85,
      "end_seconds": 275.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.69,
      "end_seconds": 286.15,
      "duration_seconds": 9.46,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's kidney stone colic, and we'll know more once the a urine dipstick is back"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.86,
      "end_seconds": 300.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "we should do a urine dipstick for haematuria"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 301.71,
      "end_seconds": 304.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "I can book that for Friday at 10 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.49,
      "end_seconds": 308.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Friday that works for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.1,
      "end_seconds": 314.96,
      "duration_seconds": 5.86,
      "text": "I'm prescribing diclofenac, 75 milligrams, once now, single dose it's for renal colic"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.08,
      "end_seconds": 318.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "how soon will it work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.52,
      "end_seconds": 330.39,
      "duration_seconds": 10.87,
      "text": "drink plenty of water and strain the urine to catch the stone please don't wait if the symptoms get worse that's when to be seen urgently"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.81,
      "end_seconds": 335.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "mm yes I'll bear that in mind"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.34,
      "end_seconds": 344.02,
      "duration_seconds": 7.68,
      "text": "I'll want another look in one week. So, I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 345.42,
      "end_seconds": 347.84,
